WHAT'S HERE
    README_NHLUA    this file
    nhlua          The NetHack source tree for Lua.
    nhlua-update.sh Update this tree from a release tarball.
    nhlua-update.sh.tmp	   Do not commit.
    lua-*.tar.gz    A release tarball.
                   This is NOT shipped with NetHack; only used when
                   updating nhlua.  Do not commit.
    lua-*          Unpacked version of above; only used when updating nhlua.

HOW TO:
Update to a new version of Lua:
    Download lua-XXX.tar.gz from https://www.lua.org/download.html
    Verify the checksum.
    git checkout WHATEVER-BRANCH
    cd nhlua
    ./nhlua-update.sh DOWNLOADPATH/lua-XXX.tar.gz

Add a local change to Lua:
    Just make it like any other change: clone, new branch, edit in this
     directory, commit.

Q&A
    Q: Why isn't this based on the git repo?
    A: The git repo doesn't include everything that's contained in a release
       tarball.

